  "content": {
    "en": "Ruixen UI is a production-grade marketing component library tailored for the shadcn ecosystem. Designed to build high-converting landing pages without starting from scratch, it offers over 240 animated hero sections, pricing matrices, accordions, and navbars. Built from a single codebase, every component is published into four distinct registries—spanning Tailwind CSS v3 and v4 alongside Radix UI and Base UI primitives—allowing instant installation via the shadcn CLI with zero lock-in. Interactive elements incorporate spring physics from Motion, optional tactile Web Audio acoustic feedback, and full fidelity to semantic theme tokens.",
    "zh": "Ruixen UI 是一套专为丰富 shadcn 营销生态打造的高品质着陆页组件与区块合集。针对开发者从基础原语搭建营销页面耗时费力的痛点，它提供了涵盖 Hero 视差区块、定价对比表、交互式 FAQ 与现代页脚等数百个开箱即用部件。全库同一套源码自动编译为四种注册表变体（Tailwind v3/v4 与 Radix UI/Base UI），借助 shadcn CLI 即可按需将源码无缝拉入本地。交互部件融入了基于 Motion 的真实弹簧物理反馈与可选的 Web Audio 极简触觉声效，并严格遵循主题设计令牌，改动全局变量即可整套换肤。"
  },
